"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Yossarian</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/1375887-masquerade-clans-as-2e-bloodlines?p=1376653#post1376653\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">You can also get it cheaper (relatively) here:<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/product/301177/Bloodlines-The-Complete-BUNDLE\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.storytellersvault.com/pr...omplete-BUNDLE</a></div> </div> </div> </div>Even with that greatly reduced price (nevermind that you also need to buy additional products in that case) it's still more expensive per page than the official products at full price (and that's before adjusting page count for dead pages like cover and credits, which impacts shorter books more than longer).<br /> And it's not just your books. I haven't been able to justify purchasing any of the highly rated STV products because they're all just so fucking expensive in relation to their page counts.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Writer for <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/product/410713/Bloodlines-The-Ageless\" target=\"_blank\">Bloodlines: The Ageless</a> and <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/product/491569/Fire--Revolution-Carthians\" target=\"_blank\">Fire &amp; Revolution: Carthians</a> on STV<br /> Some other stuff I've done: Ordo Dracul Mysteries: <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/1138490-idea-coil-of-owls?p=1140522\" target=\"_blank\">Mystery of Smoke</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/1227848-mystery-of-%C5%BEiva-house-rule-revision\" target=\"_blank\">Revised Mystery of \u017diva</a> Mage The Awakening: <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/0B2LMDRtfCcpdZDU1dWJzT1dNeEE/view\" target=\"_blank\">Spell Quick Reference</a> (single page and landscape for computer screens)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11887-tessie","name":"Tessie","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11887_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4406"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-04-05T04:37:57-07:00","id":1378721,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Penelope</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/1375887-masquerade-clans-as-2e-bloodlines?p=1376603#post1376603\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">What about updating the Sangiovanni bloodline from 1st ed.?</div> </div> </div> </div>I intend to make them a ghoul family that allows anyone from it who gets embarrassed to join the bloodline. Weakness is they\u2019re closer death and have one less health than normal, strength is once a ghoul they can take one aggravated damage and age a week to gain one Vitae and have the ability to learn the Necromancy discipline even if their regent doesn\u2019t know it. The bloodline boon is that they ignore the effects that humanity has on interacting with mortals when using the blush of life and their bane is they count their humanity as two lower when dealing with mortals.<br /> I won\u2019t post my necromancy discipline because I\u2019ve been waiting for sin eaters to come out before finalising it and I haven\u2019t had time to look into this for a while (I assume it\u2019s come out by now but I haven\u2019t checked).<br /> Hope someone gets some use from this post.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4714-live-bait","name":"Live Bait","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"703"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-04-05T05:14:07-07:00","id":1378730,"title":"","content":"<a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4714-live-bait\" style=\"background-image:url('data:image/svg+xml;base64,');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"4714\" data-vbnamecard=\"4714\">Live Bait</a> this is very useful. Thank you \ud83d\ude0a.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"","name":"Guest","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/default_avatar_large.png","title":"","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-04-05T05:28:29-07:00","id":1378733,"title":"","content":"Happy to help, if I get a version of necromancy I\u2019m happy with I\u2019ll post it here too.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4714-live-bait","name":"Live Bait","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"703"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-04-05T05:30:18-07:00","id":1378734,"title":"","content":"<a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4714-live-bait\" style=\"background-image:url('data:image/svg+xml;base64,');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"4714\" data-vbnamecard=\"4714\">Live Bait</a> Awesome \ud83d\ude0a","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"","name":"Guest","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/default_avatar_large.png","title":"","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-04-05T06:26:54-07:00","id":1378741,"title":"","content":"If you\u2019re that excited for it I posted a WIP here <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/1317416-what-do-you-wish-you-knew-about-making-disciplines\">http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/m...ng-disciplines</a> under a spoiler, it\u2019s poorly edited because I was on my phone at the time. I think I posted it again somewhere else on this forum, that might be more tidy.<br /> Edit: I\u2019m sure someone had started a thread about making them as a ghoul family and I posted my stuff since I had had the same idea but I can\u2019t find it. I\u2019m probably missing it since I\u2019m on my phone and can\u2019t search for it easily.<br /> Edit 2: found the other place I posted it, haven\u2019t checked if it\u2019s any better edited. <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/1356947-the-damnation-of-species-random-vampire-thoughts\">http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/m...mpire-thoughts</a>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":4714,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4714-live-bait","user":"Live Bait","date":". 04-05-2020, 10:04 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4714-live-bait","name":"Live Bait","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"703"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-04-05T16:29:18-07:00","id":1378879,"title":"","content":"<a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4714-live-bait\" style=\"background-image:url('data:image/svg+xml;base64,');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"4714\" data-vbnamecard=\"4714\">Live Bait</a> thanks \ud83d\ude0a. I\u2019ll check it out later and let you know what I think.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"","name":"Guest","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/default_avatar_large.png","title":"","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-04-05T20:37:57-07:00","id":1378913,"title":"","content":"I like your version of Necromancy. So in your version the Sangiovanni are still a Mekhet bloodline?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"","name":"Guest","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/default_avatar_large.png","title":"","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-04-06T02:00:56-07:00","id":1378951,"title":"","content":"They\u2019re a ghoul family that can join the bloodline when embraced even if they\u2019re sire isn\u2019t from the bloodline, the bloodline also passes sire to childe as normal so they can be any clan but I assume the history given in B:tC is more or less true and they have a large Mekhet core (about 40% of members).<br /> I never played Masquerade so I worked on the basis that the mortal family is the important part and when went from there, also my version only gets half the slowdown in aging that a regular ghoul family gets in part because they have such a strong connection to death and in part because I want them to still be able to hobnob with the mortal elite.<br /> So mostly Mekhet but players or STs can do something different if they want and an all Sangiovanni game allows all clans and ghouls to get in on the fun.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4714-live-bait","name":"Live Bait","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"703"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-04-06T03:08:22-07:00","id":1378961,"title":"","content":"That\u2019s a great idea! I never actually played Requiem, but if I ever did you make playing a Sangiovanni sound really cool.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"","name":"Guest","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/default_avatar_large.png","title":"","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-04-06T03:47:55-07:00","id":1378968,"title":"","content":"Why you want to be us. We don\u2019t come into the Requiem blind, imagine if your family had been able to be there for you at every step of your embrace, not needing to lie or hide your nature, knowing what you were getting yourself into whether Kindred or Ghoul.<br /> Why you should fear us. The dead don\u2019t keep their secrets from us, three can keep a secret until one of them is dead, you haven\u2019t been killing people who know stuff you don\u2019t want others to learn have you?<br /> Why we should fear ourselves. Family is the most sacred institution and it\u2019s where betrayal hurts the most but is it really betrayal if it\u2019s for your own good? The favour of a powerful family member is a valuable thing and there are a lot of people competing for it and not everyone can become immortal, getting noticed just makes someone more able to... oh, too real for you? Just pretend I said something about some things best left unknown and go back to whatever it was you were doing and pretend you\u2019re any different, that you wouldn\u2019t make the same calculations in our situation.<br /> <br /> Obviously they\u2019re not all that bad but not everyone can live forever and their entry mentioned stuff so go as dark and edgy or comfy and wholesome as you want.<br /> For balance reasons I recommend having Nosferatu reduce the extra dice they get from the status merit by one to offset being able to neutralise their clan bane for one Vitae and having their boon only work for the scene it\u2019s activated in to prevent the Ordo having it too easy.<br /> And have fun, or engage in emotional masochism if that\u2019s your objective.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":4714,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4714-live-bait","user":"Live Bait","date":". 04-06-2020, 06:50 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4714-live-bait","name":"Live Bait","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"703"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-04-06T08:46:38-07:00","id":1378995,"title":"","content":"Really cool.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"","name":"Guest","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/default_avatar_large.png","title":"","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-04-06T10:34:38-07:00","id":1379017,"title":"","content":"Great stuff! Sangiovanni are one of my favorite bloodlines and I like this take on them.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24808-draconis","name":"Draconis","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24808_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"805"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-04-06T11:13:24-07:00","id":1379021,"title":"","content":"I\u2019m not completely happy with my attempt to design a Mystery Cult to represent the Black Ring but I have two merits for those who take Status in the bloodline.<br /> The first is for kindred only and represents taking up a role in the maintaining of the ghoulhood of mortal family members giving you Status number of dots in Staff, Herd, Library and Retainer, if you go more than Status nights without making time to oversee your charges lose a dot of status.<br /> The second is for getting access to the families resources and gives Resources, Feeding Grounds, Safe Place and Contacts, you are expected to use these assets to aid the family fail to do so and they can be taken off you.<br /> The Mystery Cult is speciality in Occult relating to necromancy (of course), the Patient merit, Hobbyist Clique, then I haven\u2019t found anything for the last two dots I\u2019m happy with. I don\u2019t want to just say these supernatural merits are ok I\u2019ll use them, I want something that really fits.<br /> Most of my bloodline ideas are not this extensive but the Sangiovese just seem to fit with expanding to this level of detail. It\u2019s nice to be able to share it.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":4714,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4714-live-bait","user":"Live Bait","date":". 04-08-2020, 05:28 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4714-live-bait","name":"Live Bait","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"703"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}